## Hackathon submission checklist
- [ ] Read and accept the participant agreement.
- [ ] Confirm the live HackerRank instructions and required format.
- [ ] Run tests in a clean Python 3.10+ environment.
- [ ] Run at least one model and include actual output/results; do not fabricate scores.
- [ ] Explain meaningful observed model failures with task-level examples.
- [ ] Record a walkthrough video (5 minutes maximum) and host it separately.
- [ ] Put only code and small supporting files in the ZIP (under 50 MB).
- [ ] Remove secrets and private data before submission.
